        <mxCell id="home-cold" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Show the loading percentage on black. Wait for the page, fonts and visible images&lt;br&gt;plus the 3D scene.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Loading time varies. At 100%, the loading screen fades away over 0.5 s. Page&lt;br&gt;animations wait until it is gone.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Start the following times after the loading screen disappears:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.2 s: a small point fades into view.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.2&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(17, 17, 17), rgb(223, 223, 223));&quot;&gt;–0.9 s: the point opens into a line&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.9–1.6 s: the line opens into a square.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;1.6–2.3 s: the square opens into a cube.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;2.3–3 s: the cube opens into a tesseract.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;At 3 s, the shape starts moving and responding to the pointer.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;3–3.5 s: the title and “Click here to explore” fade in together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, the loading fade and page entrance are skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="620" width="800" x="120" y="780" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="home-origin" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Nav menu opened&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;from other pages&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
