        <mxCell id="home-close" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click Close, or select Home again.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: the links slide upward out of view; the menu wordmark&lt;br&gt;and Close fade out.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.2–1.2 s: the white panel moves upward off the screen, revealing&lt;br&gt;Home. The two stages overlap for 0.3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The 3D scene resumes as closing starts. Its entrance does not&lt;br&gt;restart.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="360" width="650" x="1880" y="565" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="home-open" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click “Click here to explore”.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–1 s: a white panel rises from the bottom to cover Home. The&lt;br&gt;menu contents stay in place as it passes.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.7–1.2 s: the menu links rise into view; the dark wordmark and&lt;br&gt;Close fade in.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;At 1 s, the covered 3D scene pauses. The menu is fully visible at&lt;br&gt;1.2 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="380" width="650" x="1880" y="1030" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="home-to-works" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited Works page, with&lt;br&gt;the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;A white cover rises from the bottom over 1 s, hiding Home. Once it&lt;br&gt;fully covers the screen, continue to the selected history entry.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Works is ready, restart the times below. Loading may add a&lt;br&gt;pause:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The pictures are uncovered from bottom to top while staying in place:&lt;br&gt;Genesis takes 0.8 s, shanzhy.io 0.5 s, and Workspace 1 s. All three&lt;br&gt;start together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The heading waits 0.5 s, then slides up into view over 0.5 s.&lt;br&gt;Everything finishes at 1 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu also fade in over 1 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
