        <mxCell id="home-to-contact" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited Contact page,&lt;br&gt;with the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;A white cover rises from the bottom over 1 s, hiding Home. Once it&lt;br&gt;fully covers the screen, continue to the selected history entry.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Contact is ready, restart the times below. Loading may add a&lt;br&gt;pause:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The five rows rise slightly and fade in. From Instagram up to the&lt;br&gt;heading, they start at 0, 0.075, 0.15, 0.225 and 0.3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;All five rows finish together at 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu also fade in over 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
