        <mxCell id="works-open" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click Menu.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: the white menu panel fades in over the page. The&lt;br&gt;wordmark stays visible.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the menu links slide upward into view.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The Menu label fades out over the first 0.5 s; Close fades in over&lt;br&gt;the next 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The page stays underneath; its exit animation does not run.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Hover: name fades in at 0.3–0.5 s, ending with width expansion.&lt;br&gt;On leaving hover or opening Menu: width and grayscale reset&lt;br&gt;over 0.5 s; the name starts fading out immediately, over 0.2 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
