        <mxCell id="works-to-home" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited Home page, with&lt;br&gt;the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: pictures return to their usual width and grayscale.&lt;br&gt;Project names fade out at the same start, over 0.2 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the heading slides up out of view and the pictures are&lt;br&gt;covered from bottom to top. Then change page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu fade out during this 1 s exit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Home and the scene are ready, restart the times below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–1 s: the white cover moves upward off the screen,&lt;br&gt;revealing the black background.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.7–1.7 s: the full tesseract rises into place and fades in.&lt;br&gt;It starts 20% of the screen height below its final position.&lt;br&gt;The cover and tesseract animations overlap for 0.3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;1.2–1.7 s: the title and “Click here to explore” fade in together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Home finishes at 1.7 s. Any route-loading wait comes first.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="650" width="680" x="3300" y="1590" as="geometry" />
