        <mxCell id="contact-cold" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Show the loading percentage on white. Wait for the page, fonts and visible images.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Loading time varies. At 100%, the loading screen fades away over 0.5 s. Page&lt;br&gt;animations wait until it is gone.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Start the following times after the loading screen disappears:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The five rows rise slightly and fade in. From Instagram up to the heading, they&lt;br&gt;start at 0, 0.075, 0.15, 0.225 and 0.3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;All five rows finish together at 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu fade in at the same time, over 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, the loading fade and page entrance are skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
