        <mxCell id="contact-arrival" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Select Contact in a menu opened from another page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Over 0.5 s, the menu links slide upward out of view and Close fades out.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;If leaving Works, allow 1 s for its two-part exit; other pages allow 0.5 s.&lt;br&gt;Then request the new page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The white menu stays in place until the new page is ready, then disappears.&lt;br&gt;Loading may add a pause.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Contact is ready, restart the times below:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The five rows rise slightly and fade in. From Instagram up to the heading,&lt;br&gt;they start at 0, 0.075, 0.15, 0.225 and 0.3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;All five rows finish together at 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark stays visible. The new Menu button fades in over 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="620" width="740" x="4260" y="2885" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="contact-menu" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Nav menu&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
