        <mxCell id="contact-close" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click Close, or select Contact again.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: the links slide upward out of view.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the white panel fades away.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Close fades out in the first 0.5 s; Menu fades in during the next&lt;br&gt;0.5 s. The wordmark stays visible.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The same page is revealed; its entrance does not restart.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="360" width="650" x="5080" y="3165" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="contact-open" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Click Menu.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–0.5 s: the white menu panel fades in over the page. The&lt;br&gt;wordmark stays visible.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.5–1 s: the menu links slide upward into view.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The Menu label fades out over the first 0.5 s; Close fades in over&lt;br&gt;the next 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The page stays underneath; its exit animation does not run.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="380" width="650" x="5080" y="3630" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="contact-to-home" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:20px;line-height:28px;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Use Back / Forward to return to a previously visited Home page, with&lt;br&gt;the menu closed.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;All rows rise slightly and fade out together. They finish in order:&lt;br&gt;heading at 0.2 s, email at 0.275 s, LinkedIn at 0.35 s, X at 0.425 s&lt;br&gt;and Instagram at 0.5 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;After 0.5 s, change page.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;The wordmark and Menu fade out during this 0.5 s exit.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Once Home and the scene are ready, restart the times below.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0–1 s: the white cover moves upward off the screen,&lt;br&gt;revealing the black background.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;0.7–1.7 s: the full tesseract rises into place and fades in.&lt;br&gt;It starts 20% of the screen height below its final position.&lt;br&gt;The cover and tesseract animations overlap for 0.3 s.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;1.2–1.7 s: the title and “Click here to explore” fade in together.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;Home finishes at 1.7 s. Any route-loading wait comes first.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:10px;&quot;&gt;With reduced motion, these page animations and the exit wait are&lt;br&gt;skipped.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="650" width="680" x="3300" y="4190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="contact-target-home" parent="1" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=24;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#111111;fontColor=#111111;strokeWidth=2;shadow=0;" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:Arial;font-size:30px;line-height:40px;text-align:center;white-space:nowrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:0px;&quot;&gt;Home&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
